<v Man>Man:	I’m sorry, but our company only accepts caravan drivers aged 25 or over, according to our regulations. So...


32
00:05:50,456 --> 00:05:55,378
<v Woman>Well, that would be me, Caroline,and I’m 49 years old. 


33
00:05:55,378 --> 00:05:59,851
<v Man>And where was your driving licence issued? I mean the country. 


34
00:05:59,851 --> 00:06:05,241
<v Woman> I’ve got a licence in America, but I’ve also got one in Australia which is still valid. 

35
00:06:05,241 --> 00:06:08,909
<v Woman> Is it better for me to register the local one from your country?


36
